    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεχήμερος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for ten days, lasting ten
				days,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					349d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεχειρία δ.</span> truce
				<i>terminable at ten days' notice</i> (or, <i>renewable every
				ten days</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					20.9.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδαὶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.7
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; written 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					812i11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεχήμερον, τό,</span>
			<i>a space of ten days,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.63
			</span></i>.</div>
